Package: montyhall100
Title: Simulate the Monty Hall Problem 
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Genesis", "Navarrete", , "gbnavarr@asu.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: This package provides functions to simulate the Monty Hall problem, a probability based on a game show involving three doors, one prize, and two goats. The users can simulate individual games or run large-scale simulations comparing the "stay" and "switch" strategies to demonstrate their chances of winning.
Depends: 
   dplyr
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
